# cp jwt.env.example jwt.env and fill it in. jwt.env is gitignored.
#
# The symmetric signing key. Identity mints with it; article, comment, profile and
# recommendation validate with it. All five read this one Secret, which is the only thing
# keeping them in agreement — a partial rollout of a new key means tokens minted by the new
# identity pods are rejected by the services still holding the old one.
#
# HS256 needs >= 32 bytes. Generate with:
#     openssl rand -base64 48
JWT_KEY=
